			<zone xml:id="p2z7-0" points="677,2126 724,2112 769,2135 831,2135 930,2126 950,2108 1066,2124 1069,1967 1039,1980 965,1960 863,1981 811,1963 786,1976 737,1974 712,1954 683,1962">689,2094 714,2097 739,2097 765,2098 790,2099 816,2099 841,2097 867,2096 892,2094 918,2092 943,2091 969,2089 994,2089 1020,2091 1045,2088 1071,2085</zone>
